.NET 5.0 is going to be End-of-Life'd on May 8, 2022 (see https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/platform/support/policy/dotnet-core#lifecycle). .NET has almost monthly releases to fix security issues. We shouldn't ship this package in a new Fedora version once fixing the security issues becomes much harder. As an alternative .NET 6 is now available in Fedora and is supported for around 3 more years by upstream.
